# Packages taken out of the upstream package list, one exact name per line (# starts a comment).
#
# The brand and identity overlay removes none. Packages that carry CachyOS identity but also do work the live image
# or the installer needs (cachyos-hello is the installer launcher upstream, cachyos-kde-settings is the Plasma skel,
# cachyos-hooks is the CachyOS pacman hooks) stay: their visible strings are replaced by the hooks in
# files/airootfs/usr/share/libalpm/ and by the installer overlay, not by dropping the package.
#
# Other parts of the overlay (the installer) may append their own lines below.
